# Cloudflare Pages headers file. Has no effect locally — Pages applies it at the
# edge. Syntax: a path pattern on its own line, then indented "Name: value" lines.
#
# The CSP is the enforcement half of this repo's "zero external requests" rule.
# default-src 'none' means a stray <script src>, web font, CDN stylesheet,
# analytics beacon or remote <img> fails visibly in the console instead of
# quietly phoning home.
#
#   img-src 'self' data:   — the inline SVG favicon is a data: URI.
#   style-src 'unsafe-inline' — the whole stylesheet is one inline <style>.
#     ⚠️ This is NOT a hole worth closing with a nonce: Pages serves a static
#     file and cannot mint a per-response nonce without a Worker. With
#     script-src blocked entirely there is no injection vector to leverage it.
#   script-src is absent, so default-src 'none' applies: NO JavaScript at all.
#
# ⚠️ When the cross-format index (PLATFORM.md §5) lands, this page will fetch
# https://index.heygabi.ai. That needs BOTH:
#     connect-src https://index.heygabi.ai;
#     script-src 'self';        (and the script moved out to its own .js file)
# Widen it for that host and nothing else.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; img-src 'self' data:; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), interest-cohort=()
